{"id": 5866, "group": "campus-iiit-hyderabad-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-13T02:19:30.679209+00:00", "text": "Zomato/Eternal \n3 questions OA for:\n1.⁠ ⁠Find the second most occurring element \n2.⁠ ⁠Asteroid Collision Type\n3.⁠ ⁠3d DP - price , items, number of coupons with power to half the price..\nmay be this was the caseEternal Coding questions->\n1- find 2nd most frequent element, with simple rule.\n\n2- 3d dp question.given m amount, n items prices with nutritious values. Find max nutritious value with choosing items under m total price.\n\n3- graph question. There are n servers from 1 to n. Each server has config value. In that, some were lost. Given k config values. We should find remaining such that total sum of config values should be min. One rule: adj nodes should have exactly 1 diff in bet config values.", "author_tag": "IITD", "reply_to": {"id": 5622, "text": "Eternal oa anyone", "author_tag": "IITB"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
